OL,3,AExcitement grows for new ACOTAR book
OL,4,
OL,5,FFans of the book series, A Court of
OL,6,FThorns and Roses, are planning parties
OL,7,Fand taking days off work, ahead of its
OL,8,Fnew edition being released at 00:01 GMT
OL,9,Fon Tuesday.
OL,11,FThe fantasy series, written by American
OL,12,Fauthor, Sarah J. Maas, is popular with
OL,13,Freaders from across the world.
OL,15,FDozens will be gathering at
OL,16,FWolverhampton Arts Centre on Monday
OL,17,Fnight, to celebrate the release of A
OL,18,FCourt of Splintered Harmony, organised
OL,19,Fby fan Holly Fellows from Redditch.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
